  DTS:Description="Month-end revaluation of open foreign-currency items. Balance-sheet items are revalued at the closing rate and P&amp;L items at the period average, and the unrealised gain or loss is written back to the payment fact. EU entities revalue against EUR, APAC entities against the entity currency and NA against USD, which is why the rate lookup is done per ledger."
